                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "description": "Bounds how many records a list returns. It never bounds an accession search."
              }
            },
            "description": "Exactly one of named or item. Sections are large: a risk-factors section measured 91k-144k characters, so route bulk narrative through the serenity-filings subagent.",
